          "answer": {
           "short": "$y=x^3+x^2-x+3$",
           "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}y'&=3x^2+2x+A\\\\-1&=A\\\\y'&=3x^2+2x-1\\\\y&=x^3+x^2-x+B\\\\3&=B\\\\y&=x^3+x^2-x+3\\end{align*}$$"
