           "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}y'&=3x^2-2x+A\\\\3&=3-2+A\\\\A&=2\\\\y'&=3x^2-2x+2\\\\y&=x^3-x^2+2x+B\\\\2&=1-1+2+B\\\\B&=0\\\\y&=x^3-x^2+2x\\end{align*}$$"
          }
