     "replacement": "Each short **line element** shows the gradient of a solution curve at that point.\n\nThe lengths of the line elements do not matter; only their gradients do.\n\nThe differential equation gives the gradient of each line element:\n\n$$\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=\\dfrac{x}{2}$$\n\n‘the gradient at any point is half the $x$ coordinate’",
